---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import BookingCta from '../components/BookingCta.astro';
import QuoteGrid from '../components/QuoteGrid.astro';
import ProcessSteps from '../components/ProcessSteps.astro';
import Principles from '../components/Principles.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Toronto Branding & Web Design Studio | Ashbi Design" description="Meet Bianca and Cameron, the people behind Ashbi Design, a family-owned Toronto branding and web studio."><main id="main">
<section class="interior-hero container studio-hero"><span class="eyebrow">A TORONTO CREATIVE STUDIO</span><h1>Meet Ashbi, your Toronto branding and web design studio.</h1><p>We’re Bianca and Cameron, a Toronto design team working on brand identities, packaging and websites.</p><div class="studio-hero-images"><img src="/images/ashbi/studio-desk.webp" alt="A working day at the Ashbi studio" width="1400" height="933" /><img src="/images/ashbi/studio-detail.webp" alt="A closer look inside the studio" width="1080" height="1080" /></div></section>
<section class="section container case-story"><div><span class="eyebrow">WHO WE ARE</span><h2>Brand design and web development in one small studio.</h2></div><div><p>Ashbi is a family-owned design studio based in Toronto. Bianca leads brand strategy and design. Cameron leads websites and development.</p><p>We start by understanding your business, customers and existing work. Then we agree what the project needs to achieve and what to create.</p><p>You work directly with us throughout the project. When identity, packaging and a website are part of the same brief, we design them to work together.</p></div></section>
<section class="container principles-section" aria-label="Our working principles"><Principles /></section>
<section class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">THE PEOPLE</span><h2>Meet your brand designer and web developer.</h2></div><div class="team-grid"><article><img src="/images/ashbi/bianca.webp" alt="Bianca, Ashbi creative director, seated with a laptop" loading="lazy" width="720" height="1080" /><span>CREATIVE DIRECTION</span><h3>Bianca</h3><p>Bianca’s background in marketing and art informs her work on brand strategy, visual identity and packaging. She develops the design direction and works with you through the review stages.</p><p>Outside the studio, she loves interior design and making spaces feel special, alongside time with the family’s two children.</p></article><article><img src="/images/ashbi/cameron.webp" alt="Cameron, Ashbi digital strategy and development partner" loading="lazy" width="719" height="719" /><span>DIGITAL STRATEGY & DEVELOPMENT</span><h3>Cameron</h3><p>Cameron brings SEO, digital marketing, and more than a decade of IT experience to the studio. He plans and builds websites, connecting the design with content, search and the way customers use the site.</p><p>Outside work, you’ll find him spending time with the family, reading, or getting his hands on a new gadget.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section process-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">HOW WE WORK</span><h2>How our branding and website projects take shape.</h2></div><ProcessSteps /></div></section>
<section class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">CLIENT WORDS</span><h2>What clients say about our design studio.</h2></div><QuoteGrid /></section>
<BookingCta /></main></BaseLayout>
